# tally 2.3.1 R3, N245.4: two `with law` pins on one line, LOAD-OVERLAP. Before: 10.00 PLN.
=== lawpin_q5.tally
model lawpin
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "probe"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input w: date
input rate: money PLN

def cost: money PLN at reader
  rule one = rate

ask q5: cost with law 2026-09-01, law 2026-02-01


version v
  cite s
  governs 2026-01-01..2026-06-30
  known 2026-01-01
  rate = 10.00 PLN "s"

version v2
  cite s
  governs 2026-07-01..
  known 2026-01-01
  rate = 20.00 PLN "s"

version v3
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  w = 2026-02-01 "s"
=== expect
refused: LOAD-OVERLAP pins law 2026-09-01 and law 2026-02-01 of the law date overlap at no keys (lawpin_q5.tally:15)
